Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sixteenth  Episode\NThe Puppet Show
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.74,0:01:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, my little friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, one and all, to see\Nmy puppets!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.46,0:01:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come! Come, one and all!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.26,0:02:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come all,\Nthe show is about to begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.02,0:02:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to me, everyone, friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.46,0:02:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The puppet show of old Antonio\Nis starting!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.70,0:02:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come! You won't regret it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.10,0:02:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My great, old show\Nis always new, my children!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.26,0:02:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,For your delight, here are\NAntonio's puppets! Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.94,0:02:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The puppets!\NLet's go see the puppets!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.90,0:02:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How wonderful! I wonder what they are doing..!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.42,0:02:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a puppet show!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.26,0:02:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Boys and girls,\Nare you all here around me? Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.26,0:02:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we can begin,\Ngirls and boys,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.50,0:02:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,with the greatest show!\NGather around me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.02,0:02:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.18,0:02:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me introduce a beautiful puppet:\Nlittle Corette!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.18,0:03:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you?\NI am little Corette!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.14,0:03:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to meet you! Cheer\Nfor me, please! Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.26,0:03:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,In this show, I will play\Nthe part of Princess Snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.14,0:03:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please,\Nfollow closely!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.02,0:03:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you will see the episode\Nof the Princess and the monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have never seen\Nsuch a pretty little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.58,0:03:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What a nice little morsel,\Ntender and delicate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.34,0:03:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster is about to eat\Nthe Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.30,0:03:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just hungry! My mouth\Nwaters just looking at her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.18,0:04:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, children! Do you say the\NPrincess will be eaten or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.30,0:04:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want her to be eaten!\NWe want to see what happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.86,0:04:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, that's all for today!\NTomorrow bring me the money...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.90,0:04:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I'll show you what happens next!\NOh, my poor little Corette!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.26,0:04:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I really hope you'll be saved!\NSo, agreed, children?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.74,0:04:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me the money\Nand I will show you the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.02,0:04:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.10,0:04:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the puppet wagon\Nof old Antonio.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.38,0:04:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if little Corette is there!\NI can't wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.34,0:05:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...to see little\NCorette playing Princess Snow again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.86,0:05:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Corette! When\Nthe monster comes, I will defend you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.10,0:05:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry,\Nthe monster won't eat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.78,0:05:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as he arrives, I'll hit him\Nand knock him to the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.14,0:05:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is shouting like that at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.58,0:05:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- What are you doing here?\N- I wanted to see little Corette
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.82,0:05:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You want to see Corette?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.82,0:05:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see her tomorrow,\Nif you bring the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.58,0:05:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't go wandering around like that!\NGo on, go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.82,0:05:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know this job\Nwas so difficult!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.70,0:05:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear, dear beautiful little coins of mine!\NHow tenderly I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.82,0:05:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I speak to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.86,0:05:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm busy now! I absolutely\Ncannot pay attention to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.66,0:05:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But I brought you\Nten jars of water!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.74,0:05:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done! So, now,\Nyou can go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.14,0:05:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But you promised to pay me\Nfor this work!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.78,0:06:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want to do with the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.74,0:06:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the puppet show
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.54,0:06:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, here is the money\Nthat I promised you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.70,0:06:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So little?!\NYou cheated me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.66,0:06:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it enough for you?\NI hate greedy children!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to drive me to ruin\Nfor your entertainment?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.34,0:06:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away! If you ask me for more money,\NI'll have you declared legally incompetent!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.86,0:06:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness! Under no circumstances\Nwould I have given him any more money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.06,0:06:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even a single cent more!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.06,0:06:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to learn to\Nsave from a young age!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.34,0:06:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my dear money!\NI will never let you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.38,0:06:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the only friends I\Nhave, you are my only comfort!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.50,0:06:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,To me you are like children!\NGoodnight, my dear little coins!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.10,0:06:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already fallen asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.02,0:07:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear little coin, where\Nare you going all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.18,0:07:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not stay awake\Nso late!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.58,0:07:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll put you to bed\Ntogether with your little brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.06,0:07:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, my little dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.42,0:07:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Thief! I'm ruined!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.10,0:07:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Thief! Thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.42,0:07:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thief! Help! Quick! Thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.74,0:07:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.14,0:07:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.22,0:07:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go!\NAnd with the utmost care!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No one knows that old Antonio,\Nso loved by children,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.06,0:07:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,is actually a formidable thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.70,0:07:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight I snatched much more\Nthan I had anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.34,0:08:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm good and clever!\NI want to make as much money as possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.06,0:08:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,so afterwards I can enjoy life\Nwith my puppets!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Corette, how pretty you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.94,0:08:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone loves you\Nand tomorrow they will come for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.50,0:08:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,so I will make more money\Nwith tomorrow's show,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.98,0:08:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,in which I will show the children\NPrincess Snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.30,0:08:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There's Sapphire! I'll go to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.58,0:08:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where have you been, Tink?\N- In town, to see...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.82,0:08:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...a puppet show!\NIt was exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.66,0:08:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, really? I would love to go\Nto see it! What will be on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.94,0:08:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Today there is a show\Nabout Princess Snow and the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- It must be really nice!\N- You've made me curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.06,0:08:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- I really want to go! Shall we go?\N- We can't,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.62,0:08:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- because we don't have any money.\N- I hadn't thought of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.42,0:08:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That old puppeteer\Ndoesn't let anyone see the show...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.78,0:08:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,..who doesn't bring him money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.82,0:08:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We could get some.\NLet me think...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Even without money, somehow\Nwe'll manage to see the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.58,0:08:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a beautiful\Npuppet! Her name is Corette!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.58,0:09:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see her again,\Nso shall we run to town?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.10,0:09:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be dishonest to watch the\Nshow without paying, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.06,0:09:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it's dishonest, I want to see\NCorette! I want to see her! I want...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!\NGood heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.66,0:09:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was it?\NWho took away my roof?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.34,0:09:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The projectile hit\NDoctor Uranaru's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it was you, Prince!\NNow this is too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.70,0:09:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Exalted Doctor Uranaru,\Nwe beg you:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.38,0:09:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us some money to see\Nthe puppet show!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.06,0:09:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You broke my roof and\Nyou dare ask me for money?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.38,0:09:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- What nerve!\N- Please, we beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.58,0:09:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Before wasting it,\Nyou have to earn money!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.90,0:09:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.66,0:09:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You rascals! Forget about money!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.86,0:09:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me catch you, though,\Nand I'll teach you a proper lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.90,0:10:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Come on, kids!\NCome see old Antonio!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.86,0:10:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The show is starting! Little\NCorette against the monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.02,0:10:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So, did you bring the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.22,0:10:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who didn't bring it\Nwon't be able to watch the show!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.78,0:10:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Great! Then let's begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.90,0:10:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, darn! I want to see\Nthe show too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, we can't!\NBe reasonable!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.06,0:10:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got it!\NI've got a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.74,0:10:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?\NWhat's your idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.10,0:10:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see! Do as I say,\Nget back in the barrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.02,0:10:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Today too, just like\Nevery day, Princess Snow...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.94,0:10:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...has come into the\Nwoods to gather firewood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.70,0:10:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a wonderful day!\NHello, little bird! How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.54,0:10:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, those raspberries look\Ndelicious! I'll pick some!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.22,0:10:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful little pond! I'll wash my face\Nin this clear, cool water!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess is very cheerful..
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.38,0:10:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,...and her walk takes place\Namong a thousand flowers, she sings happily,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.42,0:11:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,when, suddenly,\Nthe monster comes out of the woods!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.18,0:11:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.66,0:11:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Poor Corette!\N- Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.54,0:11:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes the monster\Nwho will eat Princess Snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.58,0:11:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.30,0:11:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, monster!\N- Tink, stay down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not time to get up yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But I must...!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.66,0:11:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.90,0:11:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.26,0:11:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, ugly monster!\NDon't touch little Corette!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.62,0:11:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You're watching the show\Nwithout paying! What nerve!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.82,0:11:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.46,0:11:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Watching the show without paying\Nis worse than stealing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.86,0:11:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We are sorry,\Nbut we don't have any money with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.26,0:11:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'll accept it,\NI will give you this sword instead
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.94,0:11:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Here, take it!\N- Good heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.86,0:11:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But the hilt of this sword\Nis studded with diamonds!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.22,0:11:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, come on in!\NYou can watch the show..
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.74,0:12:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,...from the front row!\NHey, my sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.54,0:12:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire, I've\Nfinally managed to find you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.54,0:12:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Prince?!\N- Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.42,0:12:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And the sword is the symbol of\Nhis rank, so he cannot part with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.62,0:12:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you will return to the\Ncastle with me and no show!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.50,0:12:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No, I don't want to! I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.78,0:12:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to return to\Nthe castle! I want to stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.50,0:12:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do not obey me,\NI will tell your mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.62,0:12:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That sword is wonderful!\NIt's worth a fortune!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.02,0:12:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, little one, do you\Nknow well the inside of the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.94,0:12:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know it. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.06,0:12:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, tell me what the inside\Nof the Prince's castle is like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.54,0:12:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I have always wanted to\Nknow what a castle is like...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.30,0:12:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and a Prince's bedroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.26,0:12:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If you tell me, I will let\Nyou see the show for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.82,0:12:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Will I be able to see it? Why are you\Nso interested in the inside of the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.26,0:12:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.46,0:12:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If you describe it to me, I'll have\NCorette give you a special kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.02,0:12:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So, will you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.70,0:13:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that little\None, I was able to draw...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.06,0:13:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...this map\Nof the inside of the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.26,0:13:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got it! To the Prince's bedroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.22,0:13:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it is,\Njust where I imagined!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.02,0:13:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It was as easy as\Ndrinking a glass of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.30,0:13:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You did well, Corette! You\Ndeserve a nice new dress!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.66,0:13:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the little one! Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.62,0:13:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Antonio, I saw you, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.42,0:13:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You made little Corette\Ncommit a theft!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.74,0:13:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You, little one, go away\Nand leave me in peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.94,0:13:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I will never allow you to take\Naway the sword of my friend Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.86,0:14:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't allow it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.74,0:14:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?\NWho's on the roof?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.02,0:14:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see? You made\Nme drop my sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.06,0:14:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to take a look\Nat it and now, instead...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.06,0:14:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you say that?!\NBut you wanted to steal it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.34,0:14:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that shouting up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.74,0:14:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.18,0:14:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.74,0:14:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go back to Sapphire!\NYou must apologize to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.58,0:14:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you make little Corette\Ncommit another theft, I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.50,0:14:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't hurt me! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.98,0:14:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever you\Nwant, but please, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.54,0:14:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're supposed to be a thief,\Nhuh? What were you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.34,0:14:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.14,0:14:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything! Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.66,0:14:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of thief are you?!\NI've never seen such a thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.78,0:14:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.22,0:14:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man, if you want me to forgive\Nyou, you'll have to do what I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.18,0:14:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I will hand you over to the\Nexecutioner and order him to cut off your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.70,0:15:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- All right...\N- No, don't obey him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.98,0:15:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- He will ask you to do something bad!\N- Shut up! How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.30,0:15:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't get in\Nmy way again! Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.98,0:15:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.86,0:15:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come, old man. Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.38,0:15:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, old Antonio!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.26,0:15:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me! Don't listen to Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.22,0:15:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go with him! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.22,0:15:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he will ask you\Nto hurt Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.10,0:15:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying there will be\Na show at the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.62,0:15:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness! It's a surprise\NI wanted to give you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.06,0:15:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The puppeteer has come\Nwith his wagon to the royal castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.66,0:15:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hooray!\N- Everything is already set up in the courtyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.90,0:15:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen,\Nthe show will begin shortly...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.06,0:15:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,...which is titled:\N"Prince or Princess?"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.58,0:16:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Judging by the title, it seems interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.10,0:16:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't sleep at all last\Nnight, to write the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.82,0:16:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall see\Nhow Sapphire and the Queen...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.86,0:16:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...will react to\Nthe show, Grand Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.02,0:16:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess\Ngoes to play in the woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.22,0:16:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,avoiding her sewing lesson\Ntoday as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.62,0:16:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How funny!\NShe is dressed just like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.34,0:16:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, friend!\NI must get into the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.58,0:16:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sure Nylon is using\NCorette for something shady!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.42,0:16:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Today I will practice\Nfencing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.58,0:16:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Princess! Princess!\N- What's the matter, Nylon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.34,0:16:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess, you are a girl, so\Nplease accept these flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.66,0:16:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You should wear feminine clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.78,0:16:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, I don't want to!\N- Please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.42,0:16:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a boy, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does the Princess\Nlie, saying that she is a boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.38,0:16:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She has no idea how\Nworried I am about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.86,0:16:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This fills me\Nwith anxiety and fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.22,0:17:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Good heavens!\N- Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.14,0:17:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be a scheme\Nby Duralumin and Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.18,0:17:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- Please, let's keep calm.\N- You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.58,0:17:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess, why do you lie\Nsaying that you are a boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.78,0:17:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I want to be King! A\NKing can do whatever he wants...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.86,0:17:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...and send to the gallows\Nwhoever he doesn't like!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.06,0:17:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Sapphire\Nis not like that at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.70,0:17:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay calm, Mother! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.66,0:17:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Your Majesty? Don't\Ntell me you don't like this show!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.06,0:17:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, Prince,\Nhave turned pale.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.22,0:17:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be best to\Nstop, then, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.26,0:17:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I am doing just fine! Continue!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.22,0:17:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,La Regina sembra scossa.\NI bet she won't hold out...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.18,0:17:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...and will soon confess\Nthat Sapphire is a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.02,0:17:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Now I'll be able to become King!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.58,0:17:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You are so wicked, Your Highness, that\Nyou will end up devoured by Mephistoello!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.06,0:17:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about what you say! I\Nam not afraid of anything or anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.30,0:17:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can beat me! There!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.66,0:17:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Please, stop it!\N- Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.22,0:18:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it immediately! I\Nfeel sorry for you, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.58,0:18:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Mother,\Nit's just a show.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.22,0:18:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What harm could it possibly do us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.38,0:18:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Mephistoello and\NI come from hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.74,0:18:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the Prince who\Ntells lies? Ah, there you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.10,0:18:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!\NI really think I will devour you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.38,0:18:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, just like that!\NI can't wait to devo...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.66,0:18:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.58,0:18:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast it, it's not moving!\NHow come?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.30,0:18:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the real Mephistoello!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.74,0:18:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I will move on my own,\Neven if I'm stuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.02,0:18:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The puppet\Nis moving by itself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.66,0:18:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, everyone! I will kill\Nanyone who hurts Corette!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.50,0:18:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Corette, I'm your friend, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.90,0:18:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He is the real Mephistoello!\NHe will punish me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.18,0:18:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- Listen, Antonio!\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.10,0:18:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise me you won't\Ndo any more bad deeds!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.82,0:18:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish! As you wish! I promise\Nyou not to do any more bad deeds!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.66,0:18:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So please, forgive me!\NI will leave right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.50,0:19:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.18,0:19:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.06,0:19:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.26,0:19:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.02,0:19:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, you little brat!\NI'll make you pay...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.22,0:19:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...for ruining\Nmy show!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.06,0:19:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the cart, you old thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.66,0:19:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamma mia! I am at the\Nmercy of two scoundrels!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.02,0:19:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use running, you old geezer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.06,0:19:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send both of you\Nto the next world! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.42,0:19:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamma mia! Mamma mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.74,0:19:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Run! Run, my little horse!\N- Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.38,0:19:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.14,0:19:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! My cart is on fire\Nand I can't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.02,0:20:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You two must be burned alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.50,0:20:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My poor puppets! Corette!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.10,0:20:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I must try to get out\Nas soon as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.66,0:20:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Corette!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.46,0:21:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My poor Corette!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.74,0:21:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And poor\Nall my other puppets!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.30,0:21:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I will never see them again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.10,0:21:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This thought makes me cry\Nlike a fountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.34,0:21:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I will see puppets everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.02,0:21:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear puppets! But now it's\Ntoo late! It's all my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.06,0:21:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Heaven has punished me\Nfor being bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.98,0:21:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,To chase away the sadness,\Nthe only way is to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.66,0:21:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my Corette!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.78,0:21:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear old Antonio, it's me!\NDid you call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.90,0:21:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my dear Corette!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.10,0:21:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You caught a cold, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.46,0:21:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Uncle Antonio! When the cart\Nplunged into the river,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.54,0:21:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I stayed in the freezing water\Nfor so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.90,0:21:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You missed me, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.06,0:21:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I missed you so much! Even though\NI know this is only a dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.42,0:21:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I am very happy to see you again
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.66,0:21:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is not a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.62,0:22:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a dream?!\NBut then... let me see!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.34,0:22:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are my little Corette!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.94,0:22:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My little one, how happy I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.26,0:22:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have been more careful!\NDidn't you see there were wires?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.02,0:22:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so sorry,\NI didn't pay attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.54,0:22:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I was too happy!\NYou saved Corette, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.54,0:22:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it was me. And I saved all\Nthe other puppets for you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.62,0:22:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.50,0:22:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, child! Today\Nyou made me really so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.06,0:22:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise\Nthat you won't do any more harm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.30,0:22:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, little one! Don't worry!\NI will never commit a theft again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.18,0:22:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,To thank you, I will let you\Nsee the puppet show for free!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.66,0:22:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?! Sapphire! You\Ncan show yourself now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.62,0:22:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He said we can watch\Nthe show without paying!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.34,0:22:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Have fun, kids! Here is\Nthe show of old Antonio!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.70,0:22:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We are about to begin! I\Npresent to you Princess Snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.14,0:22:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,She is truly very lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.34,0:23:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello! Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.42,0:23:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the monster again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.22,0:23:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You will not harm Corette!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.90,0:23:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I will kill you, you ugly monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.46,0:23:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Tink?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.34,0:23:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Did you see that I beat him?\N- Well done! You did great!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.30,0:23:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No, I don't want my\Nfriends to see me like this!
